hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"520","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne logon ko namaz parhayi. Phir Aap khade hue aur qiyam lamba farmaya. Phir ruku kiya aur ruku lamba farmaya. Phir khade hue aur qiyam lamba farmaya, jo pehle qiyam se kam tha. Phir ruku kiya aur ruku lamba farmaya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir sajda kiya aur sajda lamba farmaya. Phir doosri rakat mein aisa hi kiya jaisa pehli mein kiya tha. Phir phire jabke suraj khul chuka tha. Phir logon ko khutba diya. Phir Allah ki hamd ki aur sana bayan ki. Phir farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chaand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain. Unhe kisi ki maut aur zindagi se grahan nahi lagta. Phir jab tum ye dekho to Allah se dua karo, takbeer kaho, namaz parho aur sadqa karo. Phir farmaya: Ae Muhammad ki ummat! Allah se zyada ghairat wala koi nahi ke us ka banda zina kare ya us ki bandi zina kare. Ae Muhammad ki ummat! Allah ki qasam! Agar tum jante jo main janta hun to kam hanste aur zyada rote."
"521","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zindagi mein suraj grahan hua. Phir Aap masjid ki taraf nikle. Phir log Aap ke peechhe saf bandhe. Phir takbeer kahi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne lambi qiraat parhi. Phir takbeer kahi aur lamba ruku kiya. Phir farmaya: Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare. Phir khade hue aur sajda na kiya. Aur lambi qiraat parhi jo pehli qiraat se kam thi. Phir takbeer kahi aur lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir farmaya: Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare. Ae hamare Rab! Tere liye hamd hai. Phir sajda kiya. Phir aakhri rakat mein aisa hi kaha. Phir chaar sajdon mein chaar ruku poore kiye. Aur Aap ke phirne se pehle suraj khul gaya. Phir Aap khade hue aur Allah ki sana bayan ki jis ka Wo ahl hai. Phir farmaya: Ye dono Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain. Unhe kisi ki maut aur zindagi se grahan nahi lagta. Phir jab tum unhe dekho to namaz ki taraf daudo."
"522","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Suraj grahan hua. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khade hue aur lambi surat parhi. Phir ruku kiya aur lamba farmaya. Phir apna sar uthaya. Phir doosri surat se ibtida ki. Phir ruku kiya yahan tak ke use poora kiya aur sajda kiya. Phir doosri mein aisa hi kiya. Phir farmaya: Beshak ye dono Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain. Phir jab tum ye dekho to namaz parho yahan tak ke tum se door kar diya jaye. Beshak main ne apne is maqam mein har cheez dekhi jis ka mujh se wada kiya gaya tha. Yahan tak ke main ne apne aap ko dekha ke main Jannat se angooron ka khosha lena chahta hun, jab tum ne mujhe dekha ke main aage badhne laga. Aur beshak main ne Jahannam ko dekha ke us ka ek hissa doosre ko tod raha tha, jab tum ne mujhe dekha ke main peechhe hata. Aur main ne us mein Amr bin Luhayy ko dekha, jo saibon ko chhorta tha."
"523","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek Yahoodi aurat un se mangne aayi. To us ne un se kaha: Allah tumhe qabr ke azab se panah de. Phir Aisha ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha: Kya logon ko un ki qabron mein azab diya jata hai? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Is se Allah ki panah mangte hue. Phir ek din subah Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawari par sawar hue. Phir suraj grahan hua. Phir Aap chasht mein laute. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hujron ke darmiyan se guzre. Phir khade hokar namaz parhne lage, aur log Aap ke peechhe khade hue. Phir lamba qiyam farmaya. Phir lamba ruku kiya. Phir uthaye aur lamba qiyam farmaya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha. Phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir uthaye aur sajda kiya. Phir khade hue aur lamba qiyam farmaya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha. Phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir khade hue aur lamba qiyam farmaya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha. Phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir uthaye aur sajda kiya aur phire. Phir farmaya jo Allah ne chaha ke kahein. Phir unhe hukm diya ke qabr ke azab se panah mangein."
"524","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aisha ke paas aayi jabke wo namaz parh rahi thein. To main ne arz kiya: Logon ka kya haal hai? To unhon ne aasman ki taraf ishara kiya. Phir log khade they. To unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Main ne arz kiya: Koi nishani? To unhon ne apne sar se ishara kiya ke haan. Phir main khadi hui yahan tak ke mujhe behoshi ne gher liya. Phir main apne sar par pani dalne lagi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Allah Azza wa Jalla ki hamd ki aur sana bayan ki. Phir farmaya: Jo cheez mujhe nahi dikhayi gayi thi wo sab main ne apne maqam mein dekhi, yahan tak ke Jannat aur Dozakh. Phir meri taraf wahi ki gayi ke tum apni qabron mein aazmaye jaoge, Masih Dajjal ke fitne jaisa ya qareeb [rawi ne kaha: Main nahi janta in dono mein se kaun sa Asma ne kaha]. Kaha jayega: Is shakhs ke bare mein tumhara ilm kya hai? Raha momin ya yaqeen wala [main nahi janta in dono mein se kaun sa Asma ne kaha], to wo kahega: Wo Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain. Wo hamare paas wazeh dalilon aur hidayat ke sath aaye. Phir hum ne jawab diya aur pairwi ki. Wo Muhammad hain [teen martaba]. Phir kaha jayega: Nek hokar so jao. Beshak hum jante they ke tum use yaqeen karne wale they. Aur raha munafiq ya shak wala [main nahi janta in dono mein se kaun sa Asma ne kaha], to wo kahega: Main nahi janta. Main ne logon ko koi baat kehte suna to main ne wahi kahi."
"525","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz parhi. Phir lamba qiyam farmaya, Surah Baqara ke parhne ke qareeb. Phir lamba ruku kiya. Phir uthaye aur lamba qiyam farmaya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha. Phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir sajda kiya. Phir khade hue aur lamba qiyam farmaya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha. Phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir uthaye aur lamba qiyam farmaya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha. Phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha. Phir sajda kiya. Phir phire jabke suraj khul chuka tha. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chaand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain. Unhe kisi ki maut aur zindagi se grahan nahi lagta. Phir jab tum ye dekho to Allah ko yaad karo. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum ne tumhe dekha ke tum ne apne maqam mein koi cheez pakdi, phir hum ne tumhe dekha ke tum peechhe hate. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne Jannat dekhi to main ne angooron ka khosha pakda. Aur agar main use pata to tum is mein se khate jab tak duniya baqi rehti. Aur mujhe Dozakh dikhayi gayi. Phir main ne aaj jaisa manzar kabhi nahi dekha jo sab se bhayanak ho. Aur main ne us ke aksar walon ko aurtein dekha. Unhon ne arz kiya: Kis wajah se Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Un ke kufr se. Arz kiya gaya: Kya wo Allah se kufr karti hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo shohar ki na-shukri karti hain aur ehsan ki na-shukri karti hain. Agar tum un mein se ek se poori umar ehsan karo, phir wo tum se koi cheez dekhe to kahegi: Main ne tum se kabhi bhalayi nahi dekhi."
"526","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua to pukara gaya: Beshak namaz jama karne wali hai. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek sajde mein do ruku kiye, phir khade hue aur ek sajde mein do ruku kiye, phir baithe. Phir suraj se khol diya gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aisha ne kaha: Main ne kabhi itna lamba sajda nahi kiya jitna us se lamba tha."
"527","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chaand logon mein se kisi ki maut se grahan nahi hote. Lekin ye dono Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain. Phir jab tum unhe dekho to khade ho aur namaz parho."
"528","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Suraj grahan hua. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghabraye hue khade hue, darte hue ke Qayamat ho. Phir Aap masjid aaye aur sab se lambe qiyam, ruku aur sajde se namaz parhi jo main ne kabhi Aap ko karte dekha. Aur farmaya: Ye nishaniyan hain jo Allah bhejta hai. Ye kisi ki maut aur zindagi ke liye nahi hotin. Lekin Allah un se apne bandon ko darata hai. Phir jab tum is mein se kuchh dekho to Allah ke zikr, dua aur maghfirat ki taraf daudo."
"529","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se khabar dete: Beshak suraj aur chaand kisi ki maut aur zindagi se grahan nahi hote. Lekin ye dono Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain. Phir jab tum unhe dekho to namaz parho."
"530","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua, jis din Ibrahim ki wafat hui. Phir logon ne kaha: Ibrahim ki maut se suraj grahan hua hai. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chaand kisi ki maut aur zindagi se grahan nahi hote. Phir jab tum dekho to namaz parho aur Allah se dua karo."
